        $target=<<<'HTML'
<div data-view="retargeting" hidden><section class="azs-panel"><span class="azs-kicker">AUDIENCE RETARGETING</span><h2>Turn engagement into your next audience.</h2><p>Tracked recipient records, not verified people. Links can be forwarded. Missing tracking is UNKNOWN, never proof of inactivity. No-cart observations are reviewable but withheld from automatic negative targeting. Submission dates select campaigns; observation dates select their recorded activity. Purchases after the observation dates still exclude recovery when reliably matched. Uncertain checkout cases are excluded from unfinished-checkout audiences.</p>
