 secondary" disabled>Review remaining package</button><button id="m9-pause" class="azs-btn secondary" disabled>Pause</button><button id="m9-resume" class="azs-btn secondary" disabled>Resume</button><button id="m9-cancel" class="azs-btn secondary" disabled>Cancel remaining</button></div><p>Accepted is not delivered. Unknown outcomes never retry. Pause or cancel cannot recall submitted SMS. Approval expires with the audience; long-term planning stays held until final preparation near execution.</p><dialog id="m9-dialog"><h2>Authorize this exact campaign?</h2><pre id="m9-final-summary"></pre><label><input type="checkbox" id="m9-final-ack"> I reviewed the exact recipients, messages, sender, timing and budget.</label><div class="azs-actions"><button id="m9-final-cancel" class="azs-btn secondary">Back to review</button><button id="m9-final-confirm" class="azs-btn primary" disabled>Authorize</button></div></dialog></section>
